 "input": "playtest pipeline, for the new producer. build team makes a playtest build each Thursday from the stable branch. QA smoke tests it before anyone outside sees it. community manager recruits testers from the Discord and sends the NDA. testers play, the game sends telemetry to the analytics dashboard, and they fill a survey after. designers read the survey results and the dashboard and write up findings in the playtest report. findings become tickets in the backlog, the producer prioritises them for the next sprint. bugs found by testers go into the bug tracker, QA triages them.",
